@startuml
skin rose
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description
scale 10 as 110 pixels
concise "Dishwasher" as D
concise "Tank" as T
@0
D is Off
T is Empty
@8
D is Filling
@10
T is Filling
@18
D is Rinsing
@20
T is Full
@33
D is Washing
@53
D is Draining
@57
T is Draining
@67
D is Drying
@69
T is Empty
@80
T is {hidden}
@85
D is {hidden}
@110
D@8 -> T@10 : evTankFill()
D@18 -> T@20 : evTankFull()
D@53 -> T@57 : evDraining()
D@67 -> T@69 : evEmpty()
D@18 <-> @53 : {20..35}
D@67 <-> @85 : 8
@enduml
